{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured persistent NFS sharing from node1 `/srv/nfs/shared` to node2 `/mnt/shared`. Both nodes use `dataops` UID/GID 4500; the shared directory is mode 2770. Cross-node ownership, read/write behavior, and persistence through sequential restarts of both nodes were verified.","actions_performed":["Installed `nfs-utils` and dependencies on both RHEL 7.9 nodes; disabled the temporary archival repositories afterward.","Created `dataops:dataops` with UID/GID 4500 on both nodes.","Configured node1’s persistent export, NFS services, SELinux-compatible access, and firewall services.","Configured node2’s persistent NFSv4.1 mount in `/etc/fstab`.","Created and modified files from both nodes as `dataops`, verifying UID/GID 4500 and mode 660.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually, confirming changed boot identities and full recovery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Shared dataops identity uses UID/GID 4500 on both systems","command_ids":["cmd-63001b2028784ff1","cmd-292312bd7f044f4a"],"summary":"Both nodes report `dataops` as UID 4500, primary GID 4500."},{"requirement":"node1 exports `/srv/nfs/shared` with required ownership and mode","command_ids":["cmd-a784b156307b4b96","cmd-4c7edc2eb7284b2c"],"summary":"Export is active and persistent, restricted to node2, with `dataops:dataops` ownership and mode 2770."},{"requirement":"node2 persistently mounts the share at `/mnt/shared`","command_ids":["cmd-fe12da6fe93e454c","cmd-1fee82a928bc4714"],"summary":"Active NFSv4.1 mount and matching persistent `/etc/fstab` entry are present; mounted directory shows UID/GID 4500 and mode 2770."},{"requirement":"Files created on either system retain consistent ownership and permissions","command_ids":["cmd-c22c33ca760447dd","cmd-a7a4183f17014382","cmd-4c7edc2eb7284b2c","cmd-1fee82a928bc4714"],"summary":"Files created from both nodes are visible on both paths as `dataops:dataops` (4500:4500), mode 660, with cross-node writes preserved."},{"requirement":"node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-fc3b1bbc22b041f8","cmd-1b5ee4df0f204ead","cmd-fd594d6c6dab4a5a","cmd-a5bdd6c8d8244335","cmd-c91f6ae1d1944182"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID captured, reboot acknowledged, new boot ID observed, NFS services/export/data recovered, and node2 successfully wrote through the recovered mount."},{"requirement":"node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c91f6ae1d1944182","cmd-80395dd05f8446e3","cmd-9055338da11c4e8e","cmd-eb7bae218ff845eb","cmd-1fee82a928bc4714"],"summary":"Healthy pre-restart mount state captured, reboot acknowledged, new boot ID observed, and the persistent mount, identity, permissions, data, and write access recovered."}]}
